AE PATCH RISK: MEDIUM - MIGRATE: SchedulerUtils → EntityScheduler. API: Registry.MATERIAL lookups, new material aliases, throws declarations. NOISE: Lombok/raw types stripped. Material name resolution may differ for edge cases.

